---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import HeroBanner from '../components/HeroBanner.astro';
import LongTermClusterNav from '../components/LongTermClusterNav.astro';

const title = 'Portugal HQA Visa Permanent Residency - After Legal Stay';
const metaTitle = `${title} | Portugal HQA Residency`;
const metaDescription =
  'Portugal HQA visa permanent residency in 2026 follows a period of legal stay, not the first card. See timing and tests, then family and renewal context.';
---

<Layout title={metaTitle} description={metaDescription}>
  <article>
    <header>
      <HeroBanner
        image="/images/portugal-hqa-visa-permanent-residency-home.jpg"
        alt="Empty dark wooden benches rising in a curved lecture hall with white walls and arched windows"
        title={title}
        items={[
          { href: '/', label: 'Home' },
          { href: '/portugal-hqa-visa', label: 'Portugal HQA Visa' },
          { href: '/portugal-hqa-visa-renewal', label: 'Renewal' },
          { label: 'Permanent residency' },
        ]}
      />
      <div class="bg-background">
        <div class="site-container py-24 md:py-32">
        <p class="max-w-3xl">
          Portugal HQA visa permanent residency is a later residence status after a period of legal stay in Portugal, not an automatic upgrade of the first highly qualified activity card. Count years only against the statute in force in 2026. Repeated
          <a href="/portugal-hqa-visa-renewal" class="inline-link">HQA visa renewal</a>
          files keep the temporary card alive until that later application is the live file. Family members are assessed on their own cards; start from
          <a href="/portugal-hqa-visa-family" class="inline-link">HQA visa family</a>
          coverage.
        </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="bg-background-alt">
      <div class="site-container max-w-3xl py-24 md:py-32">
        <section>
          <h2>What the timing test actually is</h2>
          <p class="mt-6">
            Permanent residence looks backward at legal residence already completed, including absences that may break or pause the count. The required period is set in immigration law as amended, not in a forum screenshot. Confirm the 2026 period and the absence rules before you treat a calendar as complete. Time spent waiting for a first decision is not always the same as time spent as a resident.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mt-24">
          <h2>What else the file has to show</h2>
          <p class="mt-6">
            Expect updated identity and record evidence, proof of subsistence, and a residence history that matches the registered address. Highly qualified activity was the basis of the first permit. Permanent residence is a different heading: continued lawful stay, not a second copy of the original job test. Do not skip
            <a href="/portugal-hqa-visa-renewal" class="inline-link">renewal</a>
            on the assumption that a permanent-residence file is already in train.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mt-24">
          <h2>Family clocks and the next statute</h2>
          <p class="mt-6">
            A spouse or child does not inherit the principal’s years. Each holder’s card and absences are counted separately. That is why
            <a href="/portugal-hqa-visa-family" class="inline-link">family coverage</a>
            has to be in place early if the household wants aligned long-term status. Permanent residence is still not nationality.             Naturalization is
            <a href="/portugal-hqa-visa-citizenship" class="inline-link">HQA visa citizenship</a>.
            If the household is still choosing a Portuguese heading rather than counting years already lived here, start with
            <a href="/portugal-hqa-visa-vs-golden-visa" class="inline-link">HQA visa vs Golden Visa</a>.
            The program overview is the
            <a href="/portugal-hqa-visa" class="inline-link">Portugal HQA visa</a>
            guide.
          </p>
        </section>

        <LongTermClusterNav current="/portugal-hqa-visa-permanent-residency" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="bg-cta-tint">
      <div class="site-container flex flex-col items-start gap-6 py-24 md:py-32">
        <h2 class="max-w-3xl">Count legal stay against the 2026 statute, not against the first visa vignette</h2>
        <p class="max-w-2xl">
          This page is informational. It is not legal, tax, or immigration advice. Periods, absences, and evidence lists change. A licensed professional should read your travel history and card dates against the current permanent-residence rules.
        </p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-cta">Discuss whether permanent residence is the live file</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>
